# A blank disk of 32 MB (964 cylinders, 4 heads, 17 sectors: 65,552 sectors):
# a Primary DOS Partition of all of it, made active, and displayed.
disk 33562624 964/4/17
expect table
expect sectors
wait A:\\>
type FDISK
key ret
screen main
key 1 ret
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
screen create-primary
key ret
screen restart
key spc
wait A:\\>
type FDISK
key ret
wait Enter choice
key 4 ret
screen display
key esc
wait Enter choice
key esc
wait A:\\>
quit
